    {
      "id": "top10-2013",
      "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/OWASP/Top10/master/2013/OWASP%20Top%2010%20-%202013.pdf",
      "reader": "pdf-paper",
      "page": "https://github.com/OWASP/Top10/blob/master/2013/OWASP%20Top%2010%20-%202013.pdf",
      "title": "OWASP Top 10 – 2013",
      "version": "2013",
      "page_titles": {
        "2": "About OWASP (2013)",
        "3": "Introduction (2013)",
        "4": "Release Notes: What Changed From 2010 to 2013",
        "5": "Application Security Risks (2013)",
        "6": "OWASP Top 10 Application Security Risks – 2013",
        "7": "2013-A1 – Injection",
        "8": "2013-A2 – Broken Authentication and Session Management",
        "9": "2013-A3 – Cross-Site Scripting (XSS)",
        "10": "2013-A4 – Insecure Direct Object References",
        "11": "2013-A5 – Security Misconfiguration",
        "12": "2013-A6 – Sensitive Data Exposure",
        "13": "2013-A7 – Missing Function Level Access Control",
        "14": "2013-A8 – Cross-Site Request Forgery (CSRF)",
        "15": "2013-A9 – Using Components with Known Vulnerabilities",
        "16": "2013-A10 – Unvalidated Redirects and Forwards",
        "17": "What's Next for Developers (2013)",
        "18": "What's Next for Verifiers (2013)",
        "19": "What's Next for Organizations (2013)",
        "20": "Note About Risks (2013)",
        "21": "Details About Risk Factors (2013)"
      },
      "skip_lines": [
        "^(Security|Weakness|Attack|Vectors|Technical|Impacts Threat|Agents|Business|Impacts)$",
        "^A(10|[1-9])$"
      ],
      "added": "2026-10-06",
      "note": "Редакція 2013 лежить у репозиторії лише PDF-ом (буклет, одна тема на сторінку). Розділи — сторінки з назвами з поля page_titles; підписи колонок таблиці ризику викинуто. Редакцій 2010 і старіших немає ні в репозиторіях OWASP, ні на owasp.org. Мітка — «2013»."
    },
